  <section class="mission-section mission-section-alt">
    <div class="mission-section-inner">
      <div class="section-label">What came next</div>
      <p class="mission-text">The forum set the stage for <a href="/missions/njord-2026">Njord 2026</a> in Trondheim and for our first field mission, <a href="/missions/namibia-2026">Namibia 2026</a>. The next edition is planned for 2027: to take part, <a href="/contact">get in touch with us</a>.</p>
